<title>PERU: Peru's Cementos Lima to issue $20 mln bonds.</title>
<headline>Peru's Cementos Lima to issue $20 mln bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's biggest cement producer, Cementos Lima, was due to make Thursday a $20 million bond issue, a report from the Lima stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The bonds will be issued with an annual interest rate of 7.875 percent and placed at par, the report added.</p>
<p>The offer is the first in a $60 million debt issue Cementos Lima is carrying out to finance the expansion of the company's factory in Atocongo.</p>
<p>((-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
